  (text "MothDeck handheld carrier. DOIT ESP32 DevKit V1, 30-pin, ESP32-D0WD.\nGPIO0, GPIO2, GPIO12 and GPIO15 stay open (strapping). GPIO6-11 are inside the module.\nPCM5102 SCK is tied to GND so the DAC PLL runs without a master clock.\nKeypad columns are input-only and have 10k pull-ups. The membrane is rotated 90 degrees clockwise;\nfirmware remaps membrane row/col to visual key order. See the README pin table.\nPower: cell to TP4056 B+/B-. Protected OUT+ through SW1 into the AP2112. 3V3 feeds the DevKit 3V3 pin.\nDo not use the DevKit VIN pin. The onboard AMS1117 cannot regulate a single Li-ion cell."
    (at 25 250 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6))) (uuid "c21954b2-6ed2-42c2-9c03-7eb3f2900c0c"))
)
